/* DATA DESCRIPTION:
Citation:	Singh, Dharmendra Pratap (2026): δ¹⁵N and TN records of sediment core SSD004 GC11 [dataset]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.993903, 
	In: Singh, DP (2026): Basin-scale Arabian Sea denitrification reconstruction based on δ¹⁵N records including core SSD004 GC11 [dataset bundled publication]. PANGAEA, https://doi.org/10.1594/PANGAEA.993898
Abstract:	This dataset provides nitrogen isotopic composition (δ¹⁵N) and total nitrogen (TN) measurements from marine sediment core SSD004 GC11 in the southern Arabian Sea covering the last ~167 ka. The records document variability in water-column denitrification, an important control on marine nitrogen cycling and atmospheric N₂O emissions. δ¹⁵N values indicate strong coupling between primary productivity and denitrification during warm intervals, with weaker coupling during cold periods despite continued productivity linked to winter monsoon mixing.
Keyword(s):	Arabian Sea; d15N; Sedimentary geochemistry; Stack; TN
Related to:	Pawar, Rahul; Singh, Dharmendra Pratap; Saraswat, Rajeev; Maurya, Abhayanand Singh (2026): Orbital forcing regulated Arabian Sea denitrification during the late Pleistocene. Global and Planetary Change, 259, 105373, https://doi.org/10.1016/j.gloplacha.2026.105373
Funding:	Science and Engineering Research Board (SERB), grant/award no. SRG/2021/000620
Coverage:	LATITUDE: 6.000000 * LONGITUDE: 78.931200
	MINIMUM DEPTH, sediment/rock: 0.005 m * MAXIMUM DEPTH, sediment/rock: 5.835 m
Event(s):	SSD004_GC11 * LATITUDE: 6.000000 * LONGITUDE: 78.931200 * ELEVATION: -2901.0 m * BASIS: Sindhu Sadhana (URI: https://www.nio.res.in/research/research-vessels/rv-sindhu-sadhana) * METHOD/DEVICE: Gravity corer (GC)
Parameter(s):	DEPTH, sediment/rock [m] (Depth sed) * GEOCODE * PI: Singh, Dharmendra Pratap (https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5563-1633, dharmendra.singh@es.iitr.ac.in)
	Depth, sediment/rock, top/minimum [m] (Depth sed top) * PI: Singh, Dharmendra Pratap (https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5563-1633, dharmendra.singh@es.iitr.ac.in)
	Depth, sediment/rock, bottom/maximum [m] (Depth sed bot) * PI: Singh, Dharmendra Pratap (https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5563-1633, dharmendra.singh@es.iitr.ac.in)
	AGE [ka BP] (Age) * GEOCODE * PI: Singh, Dharmendra Pratap (https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5563-1633, dharmendra.singh@es.iitr.ac.in)
	δ15N, bulk sediment [‰ air] (δ15N bulk) * PI: Singh, Dharmendra Pratap (https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5563-1633, dharmendra.singh@es.iitr.ac.in) * METHOD/DEVICE: Isotope Ratio Mass Spectrometer (IRMS) Thermo Fisher Scientific, MAT 253 Plus
	Nitrogen, total [%] (TN) * PI: Singh, Dharmendra Pratap (https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5563-1633, dharmendra.singh@es.iitr.ac.in) * METHOD/DEVICE: Isotope Ratio Mass Spectrometer (IRMS) Thermo Fisher Scientific, MAT 253 Plus * COMMENT: wt. %
